<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:mishnah:makkot/3/16"><tei:p>Rabbi Ḥananyah ben Akashyah said: The Holy One, blessed be he, desired to purify Israel; hence he gave them a Torah rich in rules of conduct, as it is said: “The Lord was pleased, for the sake of [Israel’s] righteousness, to render the Torah great and glorious.”</tei:p></tei:div>
